onment, Science, Technology, and Information. She holds a BSc in Banking and Finance from Central University and an MSc in Accounting from the University of Ghana Business School and is currently preparing for her ICA Level 2 exams. Outside of work, she enjoys sightseeing, swimming, reading, and hiking.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ohemaa Akosua Ateah is a dedicated Finance Officer at AIMS Ghana, where she efficiently manages financial operations, including financial reporting and supporting the audit process. She ensures compliance with financial regulations and supports the organization&#8217;s financial planning and analysis. Ohemaa began her career with internships at Societe Generale Bank and gained valuable experience during her<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":12,"featured_media":12048,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":"","profile-name":"Ohemaa Akosua Ateah","profile-position":"Finance Officer","profile-tagline":""},"tags":[],"people_types":[12],"acf":[],"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/01\/IMG_7797-Edit-1-e1736798699899.jpg","coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/joel\/","display_name":"joel"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 4 years ago","modified":"Updated 10 months ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on January 28, 2022","modified":"Updated on January 13, 2025"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on January 28, 2022 2:24 pm","modified":"Updated on January 13, 2025 8:05 pm"},"featured_img_caption":"","tax_additional":{"post_tag":{"linked":[],"unlinked":[],"slug":"post_tag","name":"Tags"},"people_types":{"linked":["<a href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/person_type\/management\/\" class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Management<\/a>"],"unlinked":["<span class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Management<\/span>"],"slug":"people_types","name":"Person Type"}},"series_order":"","_li